a former senior advisor to president  Trump's election campaign pleaded guilty  to charges of federal conspiracy and  making false statements the plea entered  by Rick gates on Friday says he will  fully cooperate with Special Counsel  Robert Muller's Russia investigation  gates is now the fifth person to enter a  guilty plea as part of Muller's probe  Paula Reid is at the White House with  more Paula good morning good morning the  gates plea caps off what has been a busy  week for the special counsel's office  and gates is likely to be a very  valuable witness for them as he had  access to the highest levels of the  Trump campaign and could provide  valuable evidence against his former  business associate and former Trump  campaign chairman Paul metaphors at the  federal courthouse in Washington Friday  Rick Gates became the fifth defendant to  plead guilty and special counsel Robert  Muller's Russia investigation gates  admitted to charges of conspiring  against the US and lying to federal  authorities in a recent interview with  investigators in October Muller charged  gates and former Trump campaign chairman  Paul Manafort with 12 counts related to  their lobbying efforts on behalf of  foreign governments on Thursday a  federal grand jury in Virginia returned  an additional 32 count indictment  against gates in Manafort for tax  evasion and bank fraud before he agreed  to cooperate gates was facing the  possibility of decades behind bars but  under the terms of his plea agreement he  now faces between 57 and 71 months in  prison and that could be shortened based  on his cooperation Paul Manafort has  done an amazing job the White House says  so far tried to distance the president  from his former campaign chairman and  his business associate saying back in  October the charges against metaphor in  gates had nothing to do with the  president or his campaign there are no  activities or official capacity in which  the Trump campaign was engaged in any of  these activities most of them took place  well before the campaign ever even  existed but Gates is now the third Trump  associate known to be working with  Muller's investigation  and his plea deal will put the spotlight  on manna fort who has given no  indication he intends to cooperate Menna  fort released a statement friday  reiterating his innocence and saying  gates decision does not alter his  commitment to defend himself against  quote untrue piled up charges if  metaphor decided to cooperate he could  provide special counsel with evidence  about that trumped our meeting with the  Russians that he attended and also why  the Trump campaign pushed to make the  Republican party platform more friendly  to Russia but so far no indication he  wants to play ball  he's expected to go to trial in the fall  Anthony Paula Reid at the White House  this morning thanks Paul up
 

